Welcome to the {{.ProjectName}} documentation.

This is a small, polished example set. Replace its copy with the concepts, workflows, and reference material your users actually need.

## What this starter shows

- A clear introduction and first-run path
- Folder-based navigation
- Previous and next page links
- Tables and syntax-highlighted code blocks
- Raw Markdown pages and a public `/llms.txt` index

## Suggested structure

| Page | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| Getting Started | Give a new user one successful first run |
| Example Guide | Show one complete workflow from start to finish |
| FAQ | Remove the final common objections |

Start with [Getting Started](/docs/getting-started). Delete every example page that does not earn its place.
